Buriko/OpenBGI plugin for Enginehost
Enginehost wrapper and integration code: Copyright the Enginehost contributors, GPL-3.0 (this branch's LICENSE).

The merged plugin lines (plugin/*) are different: they carry OpenBGI (https://github.com/Droidtop/enginehost-buriko-plugin,
branch engine/0.0.1), whose LICENSE is the GPL, version 2. Its README says "GPL-2.0" and its sources carry no
"or later" grant. The lines therefore keep upstream's GPL-2.0 LICENSE (a per-line root file here) instead of the
GPL-3.0 text, because GPL-3.0 cannot be put on code that is GPL-2.0-only.

OPEN QUESTION for the owner: the wrapper in this branch is GPL-3.0, which is not compatible with GPL-2.0-only code
in one distributed work. Either the wrapper is also offered under GPL-2.0 (or GPL-2.0-or-later) for this line, or
an "or later" grant is obtained from OpenBGI's authors. Until decided the line is GPL-2.0 as upstream has it.
